       "_type": "block",
       "_key": "k43",
       "style": "normal",
       "children": [
        {
         "_type": "span",
         "text": "After a short warm-up we work through a sequence for legs, back, shoulders and trunk. Springs are heavier than in Foundations and some exercises are done standing or kneeling on the carriage.",
